        with <b>@theoriticalWeight.ToString("0.###") MT finished product</b>.
        Yield is <b>@yieldValue.ToString("0.00")%</b>.
        Total downtime recorded is <b>@totalDelayDuration minutes</b>.
    </div>

    <div class="row">

        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card section-card">
                <div class="card-header">Downtime by Agency</div>
